+		 * nothing after them.  %4x converts the leading digits and
+		 * ignores the rest, so "<fsname>-MDT00001" and
+		 * "<fsname>-MDT0000_UUID" both anchored MDT0000 at an index
+		 * never written for it -- a short answer with nothing said,
